  "title": "Coxhead Motorhomes",
  "html": "<div class=\"task note-list\"><h3>Questions 1–10</h3><p class=\"instructions\">Complete the notes. Write <strong>ONE WORD AND/OR A NUMBER</strong> for each answer.</p><h4 class=\"task-title\">Coxhead Motorhomes</h4><div class=\"form-row \">Representative: Dave Sparrow</div><div class=\"form-row \">Model of motorhome recommended: ‘Two berth end kitchen’</div><div class=\"form-row \">Cost £545 – £755 per week</div><div class=\"form-row \">Damage deposit: £<input class=\"gap choice-gap\" data-q=\"1\" id=\"q1\" name=\"q1\" placeholder=\"1\" aria-label=\"Question 1\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-min-width=\"135\" style=\"--listening-gap-width:135px\"> (for drivers of 21 – 25)</div><div class=\"form-row \">No charge for an <input class=\"gap choice-gap\" data-q=\"2\" id=\"q2\" name=\"q2\" placeholder=\"2\" aria-label=\"Question 2\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-min-width=\"135\" style=\"--listening-gap-width:135px\"> driver</div><div class=\"form-row \">An <input class=\"gap choice-gap\" data-q=\"3\" id=\"q3\" name=\"q3\" placeholder=\"3\" aria-label=\"Question 3\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-min-width=\"135\" style=\"--listening-gap-width:135px\"> driving licence is acceptable</div><div class=\"form-row \">All vehicles are under 30 months old</div><div class=\"form-row \">All motorhomes have <input class=\"gap choice-gap\" data-q=\"4\" id=\"q4\" name=\"q4\" placeholder=\"4\" aria-label=\"Question 4\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-min-width=\"135\" style=\"--listening-gap-width:135px\"> gearboxes</div><div class=\"form-row \">Customers’ <input class=\"gap choice-gap\" data-q=\"5\" id=\"q5\" name=\"q5\" placeholder=\"5\" aria-label=\"Question 5\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-min-width=\"135\" style=\"--listening-gap-width:135px\"> are allowed</div><div class=\"form-row section-heading\">Facilities</div><div class=\"form-row \">All cooking facilities including a <input class=\"gap choice-gap\" data-q=\"6\" id=\"q6\" name=\"q6\" placeholder=\"6\" aria-label=\"Question 6\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-min-width=\"135\" style=\"--listening-gap-width:135px\"> and a microwave</div><div class=\"form-row \">A <input class=\"gap choice-gap\" data-q=\"7\" id=\"q7\" name=\"q7\" placeholder=\"7\" aria-label=\"Question 7\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-min-width=\"135\" style=\"--listening-gap-width:135px\"> (new this year)</div><div class=\"form-row \">Satellite navigation system</div><div class=\"form-row \">A <input class=\"gap choice-gap\" data-q=\"8\" id=\"q8\" name=\"q8\" placeholder=\"8\" aria-label=\"Question 8\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-min-width=\"135\" style=\"--listening-gap-width:135px\"> rack</div><div class=\"form-row \">Electricity: mains hook-up or can hire a <input class=\"gap choice-gap\" data-q=\"9\" id=\"q9\" name=\"q9\" placeholder=\"9\" aria-label=\"Question 9\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-min-width=\"135\" style=\"--listening-gap-width:135px\"></div><div class=\"form-row section-heading\">Collection</div><div class=\"form-row \">Nearest station: <input class=\"gap choice-gap\" data-q=\"10\" id=\"q10\" name=\"q10\" placeholder=\"10\" aria-label=\"Question 10\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-min-width=\"135\" style=\"--listening-gap-width:135px\"> (customers can be picked up from there)</div></div>",
